<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at Aug +4 cents, Aug +6 cents.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at Aug +4 cents, Aug +6 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent traded twice at steady to slightly higher levels on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>A cargo loading Aug 10-12 traded at Aug Brent +4 cents, in line with a deal on Tuesday, and a cargo loading Aug 11-13 traded at Aug Brent +6 cents, they said.</p>
<p>There were no Brents nominated loading dates on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
</text>
